      "color": "1",
      "text": "# 📅 2026-09-22 デイリートレンド\n\n**🔥 本日の最重要ニュース**\nThis 25-Year-Old Raised Over $100 Million For His AI Data Startup At A $4 Billion Valuation\n\n[出典リンク](https://www.forbes.com/sites/annatong/2026/09/22/this-25-year-old-raised-over-100-million-for-his-ai-data-startup-at-a-4-billion-valuation/)"
